          "body": "/** Accepted cash, coins and notes alike. Values are whole rupees. */\npublic enum Coin {\n    ONE(1), FIVE(5), TEN(10), TWENTY(20), FIFTY(50), HUNDRED(100);\n\n    private final int value;\n\n    Coin(int value) {\n        this.value = value;\n    }\n\n    public int value() { return value; }\n}"
