      "title": "Requirement 5: a new state and a new payment method",
      "text": "`OutOfServiceState` is a new class and no existing state changes. A card sale goes through the `PaymentMethod` interface: charge first, refund if the dispenser jams. Adding QR payment later is another implementation of the same interface.",
